WEBVTT

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.870
Poor Kana-chan.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:19.830
I bet her grandmother from the Nakamachi
side really regrets that it came to this...

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.580
And her parents?

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.970
Well, they died quite a while ago.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.570
Grandma,

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.590
I'm all alone now.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:31.880
My First Time, All Alone...

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.550
Grandma.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.290
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.400
Didn't anyone tell you?

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.350
We were told to remove all
of the old lady's things.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.010
All of it?

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.690
Even the wardrobe that she loved so much?

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.780
Even her dresser?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.240
Even her frog statue?!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.340
Are you taking me too?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.270
What are you talking about, miss?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.540
Me too!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.530
They're going to sell me too!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:17.510
Mr. Iiji is taking me away, taking me away.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:21.520
Noooo!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.480
What's up with her?

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.360
Who knows?

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.260
I want to live an easy life!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.160
Done.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:43.150
Oh, it's a "We're hiring" sign!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.390
Here you go, Yuuki.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.070
Thanks, Yume.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:04.160
It's so hot!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.680
What? We're advertising
the position right here?

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.330
What about the headquarters?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:15.720
I asked them, but I guess there
aren't too many people.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.420
What?!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:22.040
Well, we haven't had a day off in over two
months except for the newspaper holidays!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.130
You're taking a break right now, aren't you?

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.640
No! That isn't what I'm talking about!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.370
The kind of break I want is more like..

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.000
Going to a public bath
when no one is there,

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.430
after getting up around noon.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:43.350
Eating oden in the middle of summer
in an air conditioned room.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:50.100
Laughing while watching the legions of workers
shuffling away to toil at their jobs!

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:55.700
Therefore we're desperate enough to hire even
a cat, so please hold on just a little longer?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.980
Hey. Don't ignore me.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:01.350
Got it, just leave it to me!

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:02.450
Huh?

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:06.630
Hina-chan, will you give me a hand?

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.590
But where are we going?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.110
You'll like it!

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.290
Yume, the afternoon delivery
will be here soon.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.870
Yume...

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:26.440
Yume left me here and went to some nice place
with someone else to do something fun.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.040
Some nice place to do something fun...

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.720
Some nice place to do something fun...

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.990
I'll do something fun with you, chief.

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.820
You've been drinking in
the afternoon again.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:44.910
It was just a joke! A joke, chief!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:51.240
But I hope someone sees this and
we finally get a good girl!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:56.210
Something fun, something fun...

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:56.200
Yeah, we really could use
someone good. Wait, girl?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:06:00.950
A clumsy ten year old girl
with glasses and braids.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:05.180
Or a prissy fourteen year old tsundere queen.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:10.790
Or an energetic, rowdy,
boyish twelve year old!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:14.890
Or a delicate, slightly sickly
eleven year old!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.040
Who should we pick?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.290
I just don't know!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.180
No one like that will come anyway.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.310
We're back!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.450
And we've got someone new with us.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.280
Really?!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.770
Where is she?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.640
Here you go, Chief! You said
you'd even hire a cat.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.310
I take it back.

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.250
It's here.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.750
All right, everyone. Give me a hand.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.290
Okay!

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:51.230
What am I going to do?

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:55.860
I got away all right, but I don't think
I can go back home anymore.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:08.660
"Now Hiring, Room and Board Provided"

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:15.150
Room and board. I guess I could do that.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.620
Yuuki, I'm off then.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.010
Take care.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:43.310
Today's newspaper is so... flat!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:46.320
Ha-ru-ka!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.360
My energy levels have been restored.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:54.200
Ahh, my jackpot horse race
tickets failed me again...

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:58.860
I'm sure I could find another
place. I just have to look.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.060
You're looking for room and board?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.160
Yes.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:09.010
I'm sorry, but we're not hiring right now.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:10.080
Oh no.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.460
Gotta keep trying!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.380
You're in junior high?!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.610
That's too young!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:16.460
Oh man.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.940
I'll find something!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.320
I guess.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.880
Really?!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.640
Yay!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:31.260
Can you come by again with your parents?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.860
Stray Kana

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.870
So I am a stray Kana after?!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.900
Thank you.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.650
Hello!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.400
You're all so full of life today!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.090
I've got to get serious about this.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.270
Failing the entrance exam
three times is just bad...

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.640
Oh, that stock is rising!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.430
I knew I should have bought some...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:40.730
I'm having a cold one when this is over!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.910
It's okay.  I'm sure it'll work out.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:11:02.440
It's okay.  It's okay.  I'm sure
it'll work out, it's okay.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:08.020
It's okay.  It's okay.  I'm sure it'll work out...

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.020
Are you all right?!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:20.950
I'm sure it'll work out... it's okay.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:22.900
Kana...

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.460
Memo.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.590
Kana!

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:30.560
Memo...

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.590
Thank god, you came to!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.110
Uhm...

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:46.120
I don't think you should get up just yet.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.470
Yeah!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.780
There's a bit of blood here.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.410
You're right!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.630
Oh, you poor thing!

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.980
The pain, let me fondle it away!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:12.040
I'm fine now, sorry for all
the trouble I caused!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.590
Wait a minute. This is where I first came...

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:26.900
Oh, I see. You were hungry.

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:30.170
Oh no, that was just...

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:32.450
All we have right now is curry, is that okay?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.130
Good boys and girls should be in bed now.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.920
Go ahead, dig in!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.570
But...

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.190
Consider it an apology for running into you.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:49.010
Well then... I think I'll just...

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.720
It's sweet!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:01.850
You put sugar in it again, didn't you, Yume?

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:04.790
How much did you put in this time?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:09.550
Well, let's see... One, two...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.060
Two whole tablespoons?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.730
No, two whole bags.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.350
Delicious, it's delicious...

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:30.070
Here you go, stir fried vegetables.

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.960
Let's ea... t...

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.870
This is good, too!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.510
Yeah, not bad!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.790
I like it.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.930
You do?

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:55.110
It's not just "not bad", I wish
I could eat this every day!

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:56.080
Huh?

00:13:56.080 --> 00:14:04.870
Yeah, Yume's ultra sweet cuisine doesn't
really go well with my new sake.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.710
It's delicious. Yume 's curry is delicious.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.370
Oh, Yuuki.

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:16.580
Excuse me!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.920
Huh?

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.700
Please, let me stay here!

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.210
I'll work really hard!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.330
I'll cook every day!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.760
So, please!

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.410
Hey, Chief! Chief!

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:41.170
You're so loud! And my name's
Saki, you know?!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.660
Oh, we have a guest?

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.910
"Dairi"?

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:52.700
Is that because you're small, like
one of those Dairi hina dolls?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.440
No. Even though she's still in grade
school, she's the assistant chief.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.510
That's why we call her "Chief".

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:02.190
Who is this rude brat?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.040
She says she wants to work here!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.670
You don't say.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.680
And she said she would
cook for us every day.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.320
What's your name?

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:14.580
Kana Nakamachi.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.600
How old are you?

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:19.620
I'm 13.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:23.220
You're thirteen?! You're in junior high?

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.780
I'm sorry... I guess it won't work, huh.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:31.250
Hmm, let's see.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.240
I guess I could hire you in two or three years.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.950
Really?!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:39.460
Yes.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.870
Lately I've run out of pet food.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:47.660
Yay! We have our new person!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:54.770
Now I can finally take my
vacation! And with tasty food!

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:58.910
Yay!

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.840
Everyone, rejoice!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:14.040
Oh my, what are these thighs doing here?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:18.730
I'll take care of the administrative
end, but there's one more thing.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:24.170
I need your guardian to okay this,
so I'll need your phone number.

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.290
I don't have one.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.850
I don't have anyone anymore.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:40.070
Is that not okay, then?

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:46.980
It's fine.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:54.480
There's an empty room on the second
floor, you can use that one.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.700
Thank you so much!

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:09.220
There's a toilet on the first and second
floor, but we don't have a bath,

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.500
so use the public bath down the street.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.620
Got it?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:21.170
It's pretty late, so we'll go
into the details tomorrow.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:21.770
All right.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:28.090
From now on, this is my room.

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:32.200
What's this hole?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.700
You saw meeeow!

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.340
Hey, can I come over?

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.710
Sure!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.910
Kana, drink, drink!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:57.190
Uh no, I'm still underage!

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.650
You can drink that.

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:01.940
It's Haruka's special homemade rice juice.

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:05.570
Rice juice?

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:16.080
Haruka's researching bio-fermentation at college.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.950
She's a college student?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:24.050
She brings home all kinds of dubious things
she makes and uses us as test subjects!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:30.340
What's with that tone, when you're about to
fail the entrance exams for the third time?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.920
And I'm a student at a patisserie academy!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.480
So that's why the curry was so sweet...

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:49.070
This room is really empty though.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:54.150
Yes. I left my house with
just one small bag.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.470
But take a look at this!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:04.330
I got this from the chief, so I don't
have to worry about a futon now.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.240
What's wrong?

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.820
Nonono, that's wrong!

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.510
Use this!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:17.580
No, I couldn't!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:21.370
I have these toiletries...

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.730
These clothes are hand-me-downs,
but you could use them.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.920
Oh, you guys...

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:33.090
And why don't I give you
money to get started...

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.500
At 365% APR.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.070
You mean an illegal loan?

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.410
How late are you guys going
to keep up this racket?!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.670
There's going to be a salary deduction for
anyone who wakes up late tomorrow!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.010
A salary deduction!

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:50.260
Shall we go to bed then?

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.800
You gave her your own futon, didn't you?

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.200
You figured it out?

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:11.140
Can I sleep on your futon tonight then?

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.160
Huh?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.960
Yay!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.210
I'm happy!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:28.790
Huh?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:34.530
The chief said it was late,
but it's only nine o'clock.

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:43.750
Oh well, Grandma always said that good kids
need to go to bed before the Tonight Show.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.430
Grandma...

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.670
I have to pull myself together.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.920
Starting tomorrow, I'm...

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:11.820
Huh?

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.040
Excuse me, Miss Assistant Chief.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.230
You can just call me Chief.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.450
All right.

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.580
Chief?

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.530
Yes? What is it?

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:28.810
What exactly do...

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.290
you sell here?

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:36.830
You're telling me you came here
with no idea what we sell?!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.680
I'm sorry!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.980
We sell newspapers, okay?!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.230
Newspapers!

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:45.230
Newspapers?

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:51.640
Grandma, it looks like I'm going
to be selling newspapers.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:57.210
I don't know much about the business,
but I'm going to do my best!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:34.120
The next episode will be
"My First Delivery"!

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:35.820
Ri... rib.

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:37.180
Beautiful blond girl!

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.010
L... lab.

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:40.900
Beautiful girl next door!

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:42.500
R... real drunkard.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:43.590
Are you talking about me?
